new-design
TODO.md

# The pivot audit's checklist. All 61 findings are closed and the work is in
# master, so what it now reads as is an open work order for something already
# shipped. Kept on disk because its last three sections are still live — the
# unfinished type scale, the primary button under AA, and the fact that none
# of it has been seen on a screen.
PIVOT-TRACKER.md

# Two docs that were in the repo and are now personal notes.
#
# `docs/wiring.md` is the built-but-not-wired tracker — most of it is resolved,
# it links to files that were never public, and a stale list of known gaps in a
# public repo is worse than none. Its live findings (the unfinished type scale,
# the contrast floor) are worth keeping, which is why it is here rather than
# deleted. Not the same file as WIRING.md above.
#
# `docs/deployment.md` records the original one-VM plan that was not taken.
# docs/hosting.md describes what actually runs, and its sizing math now lives
# there too — two hosting documents is how somebody follows the wrong one.
docs/wiring.md
docs/deployment.md
